  "translation": "Taim yu wokabaut i go long dispela de long mi, bai yu painim tupela man klostu long grave bilong Rahel, long boda bilong Binjamin, long Tseltsach; na ol bai tokim yu: Ol donki meri i stap pinis, ol yu bin go painim; na luk, papa bilong yu i rausim ⟨את⟩ ol tok bilong ol donki meri, na em i wari long yupela, i tok: Bai mi wokim wanem long pikinini man bilong mi?",
